comment_text:
Clearly the Department of Education has not improved the outcome for better results.
Congress now can allocate funds directly to States for Education.
We hope that States will assume their role by moving funding and  administreation from property taxes to a uniform delivery of education to municipalities.
A uniform teaching, certification, continued updates of ability, compensation plans;
Facility construction, maintenance, and locations responsive to regional needs;
Central management of Contracts and negotion;
Central curiculum development and maintenance with appropriate testing;
LOCAL Parent Boards to direct extracurricular courses and activities.
WHEN the current system is not working you have to make changes.

